# A spell cast without paying its mana cost (Omniscience, an alternative cost of nothing, CR 118.9) has a total cost of
# {0}, less than three, so Trinisphere makes it cost three (CR 601.2f, 118.9d: what affects the cost applies to an
# alternative cost). Bot1's Show and Tell puts Omniscience onto the battlefield, and Bot2 puts Trinisphere beside it. Bot1
# floats three mana and casts Lightning Bolt without paying its mana cost: all three are spent. Its X-less mana cost is
# untouched, so the Bolt still deals 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Show and Tell
Omniscience
Lightning Bolt
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Trinisphere
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Omniscience)
Bot2.Choose(Trinisphere)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {U}{U}{R}
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2; Ability: Without paying)

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Mox Ruby; Mox Sapphire; Omniscience
Bot2.Battlefield = Trinisphere
Bot2.Life = 17
